  "title": "Classic Simple Stuffing",
  "description": "So simple to make, this classic stuffing for Thanksgiving is moist and flavorful with lots of toasty goodness around the edges. It's the perfect accompaniment to roasted turkey, chicken, or pork.",
  "authors": [
    "Nicole McLaughlin"
  ],
